   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 6629923,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 1269699,
    "poster_id": 213285,
    "post_rendered": "The positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fbfdc62ae8b37ca86ad15c1d0653ce67e2a3cb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2, \\dots, a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"11\" > are aligned clockwise in a circular line with <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47f57bec2b79615225569e1ab7a59d042a73c48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" >.</span> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/0/cd045bc96022c4f81fccb41fb94ecd7576960b52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0=a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"10\" > and <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea327ba5f7ef61d10e7f78d8f39d1ddcc23ad8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1}=a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" >.</span> For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94b99ced775063ac4747e5136522df4b98e20fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{1,2,\\dots,n \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" > the quotient <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc475b503f5d61251bc9ca64a518434928d87ad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ q_i=\\frac{a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}}{a_i} \\]\"  width=\"125\" height=\"38\" >is an integer. Prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/a/cda33ca3d1570c42db1bae82633797418483108e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ 2n \\leq q_1+q_2+\\dots+q_n &lt; 3n. \\]\"  width=\"227\" height=\"16\" >",
    "post_canonical": "The positive integers $a_1,a_2, \\dots, a_n$ are aligned clockwise in a circular line with $n \\geq 5$. Let $a_0=a_n$ and $a_{n+1}=a_1$. For each $i \\in \\{1,2,\\dots,n \\}$ the quotient \\[ q_i=\\frac{a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}}{a_i} \\] is an integer. Prove \\[ 2n \\leq q_1+q_2+\\dots+q_n < 3n. \\]",
