    "post_rendered": "Determine all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34dd8bf3b803f221dcf33293db89edff53af0c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{Z}\\rightarrow\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" > with the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25cc1e8ae0be1fd02b347fd94be4fab88af1d46.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x-f(y))=f(f(x))-f(y)-1\\]\"  width=\"263\" height=\"18\" >holds for all <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e52775465ea20887a36a61277fb948ba35e372e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" >.</span>",
